      "id": "W1-V6-COMMIT-AMBIGUITY",
      "reason": "A valid complete close file can exist after its fsync or post-validation failed. If the skipping continuation is absent or fails before leaving a valid file, the structural chain confirms the primary despite the stated any-failed-write guarantee."
    },
